{
  "title": "Attention Is All You Need",
  "source": "arXiv:1706.03762",
  "palette": "paper",
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "In 2017, a translation model with no recurrence beat every system before it.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "hook",
        "headline": "No recurrence. Better translation.",
        "circle": "No"
      },
      "highlight": {
        "recurrence": "rose"
      },
      "gapAfter": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "It is called the Transformer, from Vaswani and seven colleagues at Google.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "title": "Attention Is All You Need",
        "authors": "Vaswani, Shazeer, Parmar et al.",
        "meta": "arXiv:1706.03762 / 2017"
      },
      "highlight": {
        "Transformer,": "accent"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Before it, models read a sentence one word at a time, so each step waited for the last.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "title": "Recurrent models",
          "points": [
            "One word at a time",
            "Steps cannot run in parallel"
          ],
          "tint": "rose"
        },
        "right": {
          "title": "What was needed",
          "points": [
            "See the whole sentence",
            "Train on many GPUs"
          ],
          "tint": "teal"
        }
      },
      "highlight": {
        "one": "rose",
        "waited": "rose"
      },
      "kicker": "The problem"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Transformer replaces that loop with attention. Every word looks at every other word, all at once.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "figure",
        "figure": "fig-01",
        "caption": "The architecture",
        "zoom": {
          "x": 0.0,
          "y": 0.35,
          "w": 0.55,
          "h": 0.65,
          "at": "attention."
        },
        "callouts": []
      },
      "highlight": {
        "attention.": "accent",
        "all": "blue"
      },
      "kicker": "The idea"
    },
    {
      "text": "Each word makes a query, and asks every other word's key how relevant it is.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "steps",
        "heading": "One attention step",
        "steps": [
          {
            "label": "Query",
            "detail": "what am I looking for",
            "at": "query,"
          },
          {
            "label": "Keys",
            "detail": "what each word offers",
            "at": "key"
          },
          {
            "label": "Weights",
            "detail": "how relevant",
            "at": "relevant"
          }
        ]
      },
      "highlight": {
        "query,": "blue",
        "key": "teal"
      },
      "kicker": "How it works"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevance scores are softmaxed and used to mix the values.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "equation",
        "formula": "\\mathrm{softmax}\\left(\\frac{QK^{T}}{\\sqrt{d_k}}\\right)V",
        "caption": "Scaled dot-product attention",
        "terms": [
          {
            "label": "QK",
            "detail": "relevance of each pair",
            "at": "relevance"
          },
          {
            "label": "softmax",
            "detail": "scores become weights",
            "at": "softmaxed"
          },
          {
            "label": "V",
            "detail": "what gets mixed",
            "at": "values."
          }
        ]
      },
      "highlight": {},
      "kicker": "How it works"
    },
    {
      "text": "On English to German it scored 28.4 BLEU. The best earlier system scored about 26.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "bars",
        "title": "BLEU, English to German",
        "unit": "BLEU",
        "bars": [
          {
            "label": "Earlier best",
            "value": 26.4,
            "highlight": false,
            "at": "earlier"
          },
          {
            "label": "Transformer",
            "value": 28.4,
            "highlight": true,
            "at": "28.4"
          }
        ]
      },
      "highlight": {
        "28.4": "teal"
      },
      "kicker": "Results"
    },
    {
      "text": "And it trained in 3.5 days on eight GPUs, a small fraction of the cost of the older models.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stat",
        "value": "3.5 days",
        "label": "training time on 8 GPUs",
        "detail": "Older models needed far more compute"
      },
      "highlight": {
        "3.5": "accent"
      },
      "kicker": "Results"
    },
    {
      "text": "The paper tests translation and parsing. It does not show that attention alone is best for every task.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "concept",
        "heading": "What the paper tests",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Translation",
            "detail": "two language pairs",
            "at": "translation"
          },
          {
            "label": "Parsing",
            "detail": "English constituency",
            "at": "parsing."
          }
        ]
      },
      "highlight": {},
      "kicker": "Limits"
    },
    {
      "text": "Attention made training parallel, and that is what let models grow.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "outro",
        "headline": "Attention made scale possible",
        "takeaway": "Parallel training let models grow.",
        "cta": "Read the paper",
        "link": "arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762"
      },
      "highlight": {
        "parallel": "accent"
      }
    }
  ]
}